        <p class="callout__title">A bulletin is a useful reference, not a diagnosis</p>
        <p>Technical bulletins and service messages guide trained technicians. They are not recalls, do not prove that a particular VIN is affected and do not by themselves create warranty cover. Ask a Jaguar retailer to check the current TOPIx version and diagnose your vehicle.</p>
