    <section id="traction-battery" class="known-issue-group" aria-labelledby="traction-battery-title">
      <div class="known-issue-group__heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">High-voltage battery</p>
        <h2 id="traction-battery-title">“Traction Battery Fault Detected” and a 75% charge limit</h2>
      </div>

      <article class="known-issue-card">
        <div class="known-issue-card__meta">
          <span class="badge">SSM76024</span>
          <span class="badge">SSM76062</span>
          <span>Published 2023</span>
        </div>
        <h3>What the service messages describe</h3>
        <p>Jaguar service messages describe an amber traction-battery warning accompanied by diagnostic code <strong>P1B48-00</strong> and an inability to charge beyond roughly 75%. The stated cause is a voltage deviation associated with one or more internal high-voltage battery cells.</p>
        <p>SSM76024 tells the retailer what battery-control data to capture and attach to a TOPIx Technical Assistance request. The later SSM76062 describes a guided diagnostic flow for post-H441 vehicles: it identifies modules for renewal, with a complete battery pack indicated when more than seven modules are identified.</p>

        <div class="known-issue-card__action">
          <h3>What to ask for</h3>
          <ol>
            <li>Photograph the warning and charge limit, and note the date, mileage and charging conditions.</li>
            <li>Ask the retailer to record the DTC before clearing it and to run the current TOPIx guided diagnostic for P1B48-00.</li>
            <li>Ask for the 40D2 module overview, battery information and 0x4A0B voltage-deviation logger output to be retained with the case where applicable.</li>
            <li>Request the TOPIx Technical Assistance reference and the written module-or-pack determination on the job card.</li>
            <li>Separately ask the retailer to check your VIN for every open recall or campaign; the service messages do not replace a VIN check.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="known-issue-card__links">
          <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--sm" href="https://topix.jaguar.jlrext.com/topix/content/document/view?id=1695831" rel="noopener noreferrer">UK TOPIx: SSM76024</a>
          <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--sm" href="https://topix.jaguar.jlrext.com/topix/content/document/view?id=1702477" rel="noopener noreferrer">UK TOPIx: SSM76062</a>
